    "outcome": "Publish a deterministic JSONL framing pack for strict LLM candidates, arbitrary DSL payloads and hash-bound runtime records, then prove a Subactor adoption path.",
    "nonGoals": [
      "Do not redefine semantic log events owned by wellmanifest/logs",
      "Do not let an LLM mint timestamps, producer identity, authority, receipts or record hashes",
